{"content_hash": "92f8a0c1e1ef73a8", "version_id": 1051, "article_id": 107, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Xiaomi launches Mijia Smart Fish Tank 2 Pro", "title_zh": "小米推出米家智能鱼缸2 Pro", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/119023", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571008887538-b36bb32f4571?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8cHJvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTU0OTc5NDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by sporlab on Unsplash", "author": "sporlab", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@sporlab?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/pair-of-blue-and-white-adidas-running-shoes-XiZ7pRvCzro?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(206, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(244, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "4886abeeaa35"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-24", "word_count": 90, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "Xiaomi has a new fish tank. It is called the Mijia Smart Fish Tank 2 Pro. It is bigger and easier to use.", "lead_zh": "小米有一款新鱼缸。它叫米家智能鱼缸2 Pro。它更大，也更好用。", "preview": "The new tank holds about 30 liters of water. The old one held 20 liters. This gives fish more room to swim.", "preview_zh": "新鱼缸可装约30升水。旧款装20升。这让鱼有更多游动的空间。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1034, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 26.975, "size_bytes": 162864, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 102, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_a1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 27.425, "size_bytes": 165456, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 102, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 29.45, "size_bytes": 177696, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 102, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 25.3, "size_bytes": 152784, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 102, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 27.15, "size_bytes": 163872, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 102, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@62070c4b/content/data/versions/1051.json", "paragraphs": ["The new tank holds about 30 liters of water. The old one held 20 liters. This gives fish more room to swim.", "A new top filter keeps the water clean. It is easier to clean than before. A small light makes the tank look beautiful.", "The Mijia app controls the light, the water pump and the food. The app can also suggest good settings for your fish.", "Some users say the glass gets foggy in cold weather. The tank is also heavy. Check your table before you put it there."], "paragraphs_zh": ["新鱼缸可装约30升水。旧款装20升。这让鱼有更多游动的空间。", "新的顶部过滤器能保持水质清洁。它比以前更容易清洗。一盏小灯让鱼缸看起来很漂亮。", "米家App可以控制灯光、水泵和喂食。App还能为你的鱼推荐合适的设置。", "一些用户说天冷时玻璃会起雾。鱼缸也很重。放上去之前先检查你的桌子。"], "body": "The new tank holds about 30 liters of water. The old one held 20 liters. This gives fish more room to swim.\n\nA new top filter keeps the water clean. It is easier to clean than before. A small light makes the tank look beautiful.\n\nThe Mijia app controls the light, the water pump and the food. The app can also suggest good settings for your fish.\n\nSome users say the glass gets foggy in cold weather. The tank is also heavy. Check your table before you put it there.", "body_zh": "新鱼缸可装约30升水。旧款装20升。这让鱼有更多游动的空间。\n\n新的顶部过滤器能保持水质清洁。它比以前更容易清洗。一盏小灯让鱼缸看起来很漂亮。\n\n米家App可以控制灯光、水泵和喂食。App还能为你的鱼推荐合适的设置。\n\n一些用户说天冷时玻璃会起雾。鱼缸也很重。放上去之前先检查你的桌子。", "text": "The new tank holds about 30 liters of water. The old one held 20 liters. This gives fish more room to swim. A new top filter keeps the water clean. It is easier to clean than before. A small light makes the tank look beautiful. The Mijia app controls the light, the water pump and the food. The app can also suggest good settings for your fish. Some users say the glass gets foggy in cold weather. The tank is also heavy. Check your table before you put it there.", "vocab": [{"word": "fish tank", "pos": "noun", "zh": "鱼缸", "note": "常用名词，指养鱼的缸", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "liter", "pos": "noun", "zh": "升", "note": "容量单位", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "filter", "pos": "noun", "zh": "过滤器", "note": "保持水质干净的设备", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "app", "pos": "noun", "zh": "手机应用", "note": "手机上的软件", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "light", "pos": "noun", "zh": "灯；灯光", "note": "这里指鱼缸的照明", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "clean", "pos": "verb", "zh": "清洁", "note": "也可作形容词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "heavy", "pos": "adj", "zh": "重的", "note": "形容重量大", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "suggest", "pos": "verb", "zh": "建议", "note": "表示给出意见", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-24T05:25:44.322164", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.35, "sm": 275, "em": 349, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "new", "s": 0.35, "e": 0.525, "sm": 350, "em": 524, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "tank", "s": 0.525, "e": 0.825, "sm": 525, "em": 824, "cs": 8, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {